    "turn_text": "politics. Hearing the word can sometimes elicit a passionate debate or an eagerness to avoid the topic altogether. But since politics are here to stay, how do we engage in a healthy way and move forward in navigating this often confusing world? Hi, I'm Rob Chag this and this is the Farther Along podcast. This week's conversation is with Senator Chuck Grassley. He has served in government for more than 60 years and is currently in his seventh term as United States Senator from the great state of Iowa. So let's jump into our conversation with Senator Chuck Grassley. Well, Senator, you have quite a long career in politics, more than 60 years, 40 years as a US Senator. You're the ninth longest serving US Senator in history. And so what are just some keys to longevity in such a demanding role?",
