      },
      {
        "text": "Some forms of criticism are legitimate while others are unfair.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The Des Moines Register's editorial misrepresented the Republicans' position by implying blanket opposition without context.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The recent 'last image bill' received unanimous bipartisan support for approximately $600 billion due to its direct connection to the pandemic.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "If someone does not accept the current situation, they should not participate in it.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Four or five previous bills passed last year with over 90% bipartisan support in the U.S. Senate.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
