  {
    "episode_id": 78079,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/8/78079.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "It's so refreshing to hear somebody in government who has that perspective. So, Senator, on January 6th, you were serving as the president pro-temporary of the Senate, and you were in the Capitol building, and what was that experience like for you as those events of that day started to unfold?",
