    "turn_text": "Well, I'm glad we did. At the time we were in a safe place, I thought we should have probably brought the senators to that safe place and done business there. I'm glad that I didn't prevail in that. The leader then was McConnell, now the minority leader. He thought we should come back just to show the people that they weren't going to run it and we lost. So I'm glad we got back. We took up at eight o'clock and from then on it was pretty normal.",
