        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Political divisiveness undermines trust in institutions and discourages civic involvement.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Public figures like senators are expected to provide guidance on encouraging youth engagement.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Engaging in politics involves significant personal risk or emotional cost.",
